   4738  7081							;----------------------------------------
   4739  7081							; Display Data
   4740  7081							;----------------------------------------
   4741  7081							; The Display Data bank is copied into RAM when DPC+ initializes the cartridge.
   4742  7081							; This allows us to manipulate the data during run-time, but have a known
   4743  7081							; starting state when the Atari is first turned on.
   4744  7081							;
   4745  7081							; Unlike normal Atari VCS/2600 sprite definitions, the sprite data in the
   4746  7081							; Display Data bank is stored right-side-up.
   4747  7081							;
   4748  7081							;----------------------------------------
   4749  7081
   4750  7081				   Zeros32
